<Base
  title={`Women-Only Kenya Safari — 8-Day Hosted Group Itinerary | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`Our flagship women-only Kenya safari — an 8-day hosted small-group journey through the Maasai Mara, Amboseli and Nairobi with a female host. Arrive solo, leave with a circle. From $8,200.`}
  ogTitle={`Women-Only Kenya Safari — 8-Day Hosted Group Itinerary | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`An 8-day women-only hosted safari in Kenya — Mara, Amboseli & Nairobi. From $8,200.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/kenya-giraffe.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/women-only-kenya.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Women-Only Kenya Safari — 8-Day Hosted Group Itinerary","description":"An 8-day women-only hosted small-group safari in Kenya — Maasai Mara, Amboseli and Nairobi.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/kenya-giraffe.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"8200","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-giraffe.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Kenya · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Women-Only Kenya Highlights</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>8 days</b></span>
        <span>Mara · Amboseli · Nairobi</span>
        <span>Small hosted group</span>
        <span>from <b>$8,200</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html" class="btn btn--gold">Reserve your place</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="kenya.html">Kenya</a> / Women-Only Kenya Highlights</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Our flagship sisterhood departure. Eight days through Kenya's icons — the Maasai Mara, Amboseli and Nairobi — in a small hosted group of women, led by a female host, in vetted, women-friendly camps. Arrive solo; leave with a circle.</p>
        <p>Everything is handled, so all you do is show up and feel. Safety, warmth and real connection are the heart of every day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 8-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive &amp; gather in Nairobi</h3><p>Met on arrival and brought together for a warm welcome dinner — meet your host and the women you'll share the journey with.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nairobi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Days 2–4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Maasai Mara</h3><p>Fly to the Mara for three days of big cats and plains game, an optional balloon dawn, sundowners on the savanna, and an afternoon with Maasai women.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Women-friendly tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Days 5–6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Amboseli &amp; Kilimanjaro</h3><p>Fly to Amboseli for elephants beneath Kilimanjaro, golden-hour drives, and slow evenings together under big skies.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Amboseli lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Nairobi &amp; giving back</h3><p>Return to Nairobi for the Sheldrick elephant orphanage and a visit to a women-led community project we support, then a celebration dinner.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Nairobi hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Breakfast &amp; dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Farewell</h3><p>Goodbyes (and new friendships) before your onward flight — or extend to Zanzibar with your new circle.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Female host throughout</li>
          <li>All internal flights &amp; private transfers</li>
          <li>Vetted, women-friendly camps &amp; hotels</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Private guides &amp; game drives</li>
          <li>All park &amp; conservancy fees</li>
          <li>Community &amp; conservation visits</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$8,200 per person sharing</strong>; single rooms available with no &ldquo;single shame&rdquo;. Small, intimate group. International flights and visas are extra. Set 2026 departure dates — ask for the calendar.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Arrive solo, leave with a circle.</h2><p>Spaces are intentionally limited. Reserve your place on the next departure.</p><a href="contact.html" class="btn btn--gold">Reserve your place</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Kenya itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="classic-kenya-safari.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-amboseli.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Kenya Safari</h3><p>8 days · Mara, Amboseli &amp; Nakuru.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="great-migration.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-migration.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>The Great Migration</h3><p>6 days · Maasai Mara (Jul–Oct).</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="kenya.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Kenya itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Kenya journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

